PHOTOGRAPHS
-----------
The destination photographs under public/images/*.jpg are NOT covered by the
above. Each photograph is a freely-licensed file from Wikimedia Commons and
carries its own licence (Creative Commons Attribution / Attribution-ShareAlike
or public domain) together with a named author. The full list of files,
authors, licences and source URLs is recorded in:

    public/images/credits.json

Those licences require attribution. This project provides it next to each
photograph and in the "Photo credits & licences" list in the site footer.
If you redistribute or reuse the photographs, you must keep that attribution
and comply with each photograph's individual licence.

